  "AboutUs": {
    "title": "About Us",
    "description": "NG Transfert is a trusted international money transfer service specializing in fast, secure, and reliable financial transactions between China and multiple countries across Africa. We currently operate actively in Mali, the Democratic Republic of the Congo, the Republic of the Congo, Ivory Coast, Gabon, Senegal, Togo, and China.\n\nThrough strong partnerships and a growing international network, we facilitate smooth cross-border transfers tailored to the needs of individuals and businesses. Our mission is to simplify international payments by combining efficiency, transparency, and security—ensuring your funds reach their destination quickly and safely."
  },
